socialmedia/

# Packaged releases (daemon installer, prebuilt firmware + bundled esptool).
# Build artifacts, and the firmware bundle is ~16 MB — keeping revisions of it
# in history would cost every clone, forever. Attach them to a GitHub Release
# instead. Rebuild: see the ZIP contents listed in each package's README.
dist/
